OVERVIEW: Update a flag's name, description, or per-environment values.

USAGE: grantiva console flags update [--json] [--verbose] [--quiet] <key> [--name <name>] [--description <description>] [--env-value <env-value> ...]

ARGUMENTS:
  <key>                   Flag key (or UUID).

OPTIONS:
  --json                  Output as JSON
  --verbose               Print diagnostic detail (timestamps, labels,
                          metadata) to stderr.
  --quiet                 Silence progress diagnostics on stderr; warnings and
                          errors still print. Program output on stdout is
                          unaffected.
  --name <name>           New flag name.
  --description <description>
                          New flag description.
  --env-value <env-value> Per-environment on-value as <environment>=<value>
                          (repeatable).
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

